<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Raise, raise choirs of angels, songs of loudest triumph,</l><l>Through heaven’s high arches be your praises poured:</l><l>Now to our God be glory in the highest;</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Amen! Lord, we bless Thee, born for our salvation!</l><l>O Jesus! forever be Thy Name adored;</l><l>Word of the Father, late in flesh appearing;</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
